        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;John Kameel Farah (Berlin/Toronto) &quot;Baroque-Mid-Eastern-Cyberpunk&quot; compositions and reimagined classics on piano, synthesizers, and electronics Saturday, October 19th, 2024 Show: 7:30 pm Doors: 7:00 pm Venue: The Annex, 823 Seymour St, Vancouver, BC V6B 3L4 GET TICKETS HERE General Admission (Sliding Scale) - $30 / $25 / $20 Seniors / Students / Under 19 - $20 [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
