        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "VIM Virtual Auction 2025"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Last year, ahead of Giving Tuesday – the global day of giving, VIM launched our first ever virtual silent auction. Thanks to our community, we raised $2,000 to support year-round programming and planning for the music centre. This year our goal is $3,000 – we need your help to get there. From&nbsp; November 26th until [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
