        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Vancouver Independent Music Centre Society (VIM) Presents: MUSIC AT THE CINEMAS: everyb0dy / Tsimka &amp; Michael Red Curated by Rob Thomson This event is&nbsp;hosted on the unceded and traditional lands of the Coast Salish peoples – sḵwx̱wú7mesh (Squamish), selíʔlwitulh (Tsleil-Waututh), and xʷməθkʷəy̓əm (Musqueam) Nations. Thursday, June 5th, 2025 Show: 8:00 pm Doors: 7:30 pm Venue: [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
