        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A pan-Asian stir-fry of music, memories and more featuring Kokuho Rose Prohibited and Inalienable Rice Revisited. Joyce Chong: vocals Sean Gunn: bass John Endo Greenaway: guitar Linda Uyehara Hoffm…"
