        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Vancouver Independent Music Centre Society (VIM) Presents: MUSIC AT THE CINEMAS: Sara Gold &amp; x/o Two&nbsp;visionary artists disrupting gender binaries, building new sonic landscapes, and expanding their craft through transcendent&nbsp;explorations of sound and sight. Fans of electronic sound art - this is an event you don\\'t want to miss! *Please note lights and audio visual [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
