    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Thursday, April 18th, 2024 Show: 7:30 pm Doors: 6:30 pm Venue: The Hollywood Theatre, 3123 W Broadway, Vancouver, BC Get your tickets in advance: $30 (plus taxes &amp; fees) https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z7MBzq9L4Ns Experience the transcendence of Ahmed Moneka\\'s rich life and artistic voyage from Baghdad to Toronto. This rich musical endeavor blends traditional Iraqi melodies with vibrant [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
